  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📋 Test Oracle & Scenario Matrix\n*Change `test_id` and `change_request_id` in **Set Test Variables**. Postman selects the mock response by request path; no `x-mock-response-name` header is required.*\n\n| Test ID | change_request_id | Scenario | Expected branch |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **T01** | `CR-20261017-001` | APPLIED PRO after 45s | `Format: MATCHED` |\n| **T02** | `CR-20261017-002` | PENDING within 300s | `Format: WITHIN_WAIT` |\n| **T03** | `CR-20261017-003` | PENDING beyond 300s | `Format: EXCEPTION` ➔ Webhook Alert |\n| **T04** | `CR-20261017-004` | `payment_confirmed_at = null` | `Format: SKIPPED` |\n| **T05** | `CR-20261017-005` | Workspace mismatch | `Format: DATA_WARNING (Mismatch)` |\n| **T06** | `CR-20261017-006` | Entitlement HTTP 500 | `Format: READ_ERROR (Ent)` |\n| **T07** | `CR-20261017-007` | Entitlement HTTP 404 | `Format: DATA_WARNING (404)` |\n| **T08** | `CR-20261017-008` | APPLIED BASIC instead of PRO | `Format: EXCEPTION` ➔ Webhook Alert |",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 3
      },
